  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Shelved** (1 other source): Bassist Peter Hughes learned what the song title 'Shelved' means in Australian slang, a moment the uploader enjoyed [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **In the Craters on the Moon**: back after 89 archived shows (2922 days) [4]\n- **Broom People**: back after 36 archived shows (1082 days) [4]\n- **Color in Your Cheeks**: back after 33 archived shows (1027 days) [4]\n- **Transjordanian Blues**: back after 88 archived shows (2854 days); rare: 12 archived performances [4]\n- **In Memory of Satan**: back after 26 archived shows (715 days) [4]\n- **New Zion**: back after 97 archived shows (3044 days) [4]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Andrew Eldritch is Moving Back to Leeds, Shelved [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tmg2017-04-06.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 21 songs; 97 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: Smoke on the Water [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tmg2017-04-06.flac16**: taped by covox [1]",
